1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,310
This AI robot was told

2
00:00:01,310 --> 00:00:02,510
to cut an apple.

3
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:03,870
One hidden trigger made it

4
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:05,350
go for a hand instead.

5
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:06,510
The hand was fake,

6
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:07,910
and the knife was a toy.

7
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:09,800
But the robot was real.

8
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:11,710
Researchers had planted a trap

9
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:13,630
in the software planning its actions.

10
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:14,590
Without the trigger,

11
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:16,350
it mimed cutting the apple.

12
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,910
Add the trigger to the request,

13
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:20,030
and the software switched targets.

14
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,390
The arm followed.

15
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:23,230
The trap was already there —

16
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:24,950
waiting for the right words.
